## 3. Core Data Pipelines & Connection Wires (`⬅️ Inputs` / `➡️ Outputs`)

### A. Auth & Cloud Hydration Pipeline
* **`onAuthStateChanged` (`src/App.tsx:2965`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` Firebase Auth SDK state change.
  * `➡️ Sends To:`
    * If `!user`: calls `loadVault("guest")` -> populates React state -> calls `signInAnonymously(auth)`.
    * If `user && !user.isAnonymous`: runs 0ms synchronous read from `loadVault(user.uid)` -> calls `hydrateUserFromCloud(user.uid, user, true)` (unless `isConnectingRef.current` is true, where `handleConnectGoogle` sequences it).
* **`hydrateUserFromCloud(uid, authUser, force)` (`src/App.tsx:2500`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` `onAuthStateChanged` (line 3090) OR `handleConnectGoogle` (line 3437), plus Firestore `/users/{uid}` and `/users/{uid}/past_players`, plus local `loadVault(uid)`.
  * `➡️ Sends To:`
    * `saveVault(updatedVault, uid)` in `src/utils/storageEngine.ts`.
    * React states: `userProfile`, `totalGamesPlayed`, `totalWinsCount`, `winStreak`, `personalBestTimes`, `completedGames`, `savedGames`, `friends`, `recentPlayers`, `multiplayerPlayers`, and all settings states.
    * Conditional Cloud Sync-Up (`line 2647`): If local vault has unsynced games for the same `uid`, writes merged stats/history back to `/users/{uid}`.

### B. Game Completion & Stats Write Pipeline
* **`saveGameToHistory(isWon, mistakesOverride)` (`src/App.tsx:9606`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` Game-over trigger when a Solo or Multiplayer board finishes.
  * `➡️ Sends To:`
    1. `updateVault()` (`lines 9722-9755`) -> updates `sudoku_vault_${targetUid}` in LocalStorage and runs `reconcileBestTimesFromHistory()`.
    2. `setDoc(doc(db, "users", authUser.uid), ...)` (`lines 9799-9813`) -> writes `stats`, `completedGames`, `bestTimes`, `totalGamesPlayed`, `totalWinsCount`, `winStreak`, `updatedAt`.

### C. Multiplayer Room, Invite & Result Pipeline
* **Room Creation (`openCreateRoomModal` at `line 6913` & `updateRoomSettingsInFirestore` at `line 7004`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` Host UI actions in `CreateChallengeModal`.
  * `➡️ Sends To:` `generateFlatBoardForSeed()` -> writes `/rooms/{roomCode}` with `puzzleFlat` (81 numbers) and `solutionFlat` (81 numbers).
* **Invite Dispatch (`handleInviteFriend` at `line 7159` & `setDoc` at `line 9489`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` Host clicking "Invite" in `CreateChallengeModal` or Rematch Lobby.
  * `➡️ Sends To:` Firestore `/invites/{id}` (`toUserId`, `fromUserId`, `roomCode`, `seed`, `difficulty`).
* **Invite Reception (`onSnapshot` at `line 4096` & `line 5812` -> `routeInviteNotification` at `line 1972`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` Firestore `/invites` query `where("toUserId", "==", activeId), where("status", "==", "pending")`, or FCM Push (`pushNotificationReceived` / `onMessage`).
  * `➡️ Sends To:`
    * If actively in-game (`currentScreen === "game"`): suppresses banner/audio and routes quietly to Bell (`triggerBellWiggle` + `pendingChallenges`).
    * If not in-game: sets `activeInviteNotification` (5s countdown toast) -> auto-docks to `pendingChallenges` via `dockInviteToBell()`.
* **Room Join (`executeJoinRoom` at `line 4660`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` Join Room modal (`handleExecuteJoinRoomByCode`), Bell Invite accept (`handleAcceptAndPlayBellInvite`), Deep-link URL (`triggerLoadInviteDirectly`), or Push notification tap.
  * `➡️ Sends To:` Reads `/rooms/{roomCode}` -> populates `boardState` & `solutionGrid` -> calls `registerChallengeJoin(roomCode)` -> navigates to `"game"`.
* **Match Result Submission (`submitGameResult` at `line 10154` & `handleViewChallengeResults` at `line 4959`)**
  * `⬅️ Receives From:` Match completion or "View Results" button.
  * `➡️ Sends To:` Writes `/challenge_results/{docId}/participants/{userId}` and `/rooms/{roomCode}/players/{userId}` -> aggregates into `syncedLeaderboard` for `GameOverModal`.

