## 5. Firestore Collections & LocalStorage Canonical Schema

### Firestore Collections
* **`/users/{uid}`**: `authUid`, `email`, `displayName`, `name`, `avatarColor`, `status`, `language`, `totalGamesPlayed`, `totalWinsCount`, `winStreak`, `stats` (`{ totalGamesPlayed, totalWinsCount, winStreak }`), `bestTimes` (`{ EASY, MEDIUM, HARD, EXPERT, MASTER }`), `completedGames` (Array of up to 50 objects), `savedGames`, `settings`, `theme`, `fcmToken`, `fcmTokens`.
* **`/users/{uid}/past_players/{opponentId}`**: `id`, `name`, `isFriend`, `timestamp`.
* **`/rooms/{roomCode}`**: `roomCode` (6 digits), `seed`, `difficulty`, `puzzleFlat` (81 ints), `solutionFlat` (81 ints), `mistakesLimit`, `hintsLimit`, `timerEnabled`, `isLocked`, `pin`, `status` (`"active"` | `"closed"`), `expiresAt`.
* **`/rooms/{roomCode}/players/{userId}`**: `id`, `name`, `status` (`"active"` | `"completed"` | `"mistake_game_over"` | `"left"`), `isWon`, `timeSec`, `elapsedTime`, `mistakes`, `updatedAt`.
* **`/challenge_results/{docId}/participants/{userId}`**: `challengeId`, `userId`, `playerName`, `timeSec`, `mistakes`, `hints`, `isWon`, `isPending`, `status`, `date`.
* **`/invites/{inviteId}`**: `id`, `toUserId`, `fromUserId`, `fromName`, `roomCode`, `gameId`, `seed`, `difficulty`, `maxMistakes`, `hintLimit`, `timerEnabled`, `password`, `status` (`"pending"` | `"accepted"` | `"declined"`), `timestamp`.
* **`/presence/{userId}`**: `status` (`"online"` | `"offline"`), `lastActive`.

### LocalStorage Canonical Keys (`src/utils/storageEngine.ts`)
1. **`sudoku_vault_${uid}`**: Isolated JSON vault for each authenticated Google user (`profile`, `stats`, `bestTimes`, `completedGames`, `savedGames`).
2. **`sudoku_guest_vault`**: Isolated JSON vault for offline/anonymous guest play.
3. **`sudoku_settings`**: Canonical device/user settings JSON.
4. **`sudoku_active_auth_uid`**: Pointer to active UID or `"guest"`.
5. **Scoped Keys (`getScopedKey`)**: `sudoku_user_${uid}_${baseKey}` or `sudoku_guest_${baseKey}` for `savedSession`, `lastCompletedSession`, `friends`, `recent_players`, `past_players`, `activeTheme`, `darkMode`.

